# Build context hygiene.
#
# Without this, `COPY . .` carries whatever a developer happened to have on disk into
# the image — a previous build's dist, a local .env, node_modules from another
# architecture. The image then serves artifacts nobody built in CI, which is the kind
# of difference that only shows up as "works on my machine" much later.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.env
**/.env
*.log
.git
